H600.definition:
(Aramaic) corresponding to H639 (אַף) (only in the plural as a singular);
the face
KJV: face, visage.

H601.definition:
from H599 (אָנַף);
an unclean bird, perhaps the parrot (from its irascibility)
KJV: heron.

H602.definition:
