KJV: Asa.

H610.definition:
from H5480 (סוּךְ);
anointed, i.e. an oil-flask
KJV: pot.

H611.definition:
of uncertain derivation;
hurt
KJV: mischief.

H612.definition:
from H631 (אָסַר);
a bond (especially manacles of a prisoner)
KJV: band, [phrase] prison.

H613.definition:
(Aramaic) corresponding to H612 (אֵסוּר)
{a bond (especially manacles of a prisoner)}
KJV: band, imprisonment.

H614.definition:
or אָסִף; from H622 (אָסַף);
gathered, i.e. (abstractly) a gathering in of crops
KJV: ingathering.

H615.definition:
from H631 (אָסַר);
bound, i.e. a captive
KJV: (those which are) bound, prisoner.

H616.definition:
for H615 (אָסִיר)
{bound, i.e. a captive}
KJV: prisoner.

H617.definition:
