KJV: darkness, obscurity, privily.

H653.definition:
feminine of H651 (אָפֵל);
duskiness, figuratively, misfortune; concrete, concealment
KJV: dark, darkness, gloominess, [idiom] thick.

H654.definition:
from H6419 (פָּלַל); judge;
