H676.definition:
from the same as H6648 (צֶבַע) (in the sense of grasping);
something to sieze with, i.e. a finger; by analogy, a toe
KJV: finger, toe.

H677.definition:
(Aramaic) corresponding to H676 (אֶצְבַּע)
{something to sieze with, i.e. a finger; by analogy, a toe}
KJV: finger, toe.

H678.definition:
