H681.definition:
from H680 (אָצַל) (in the sense of joining);
a side; (as a preposition) near
KJV: at, (hard) by, (from) (beside), near (unto), toward, with. See also H1018 (בֵּית הָאֵצֶל).

H682.definition:
from H680 (אָצַל); noble;
